OL,3,GNEWSALatest data shows roads most
OL,4,Aimpacted by closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictoria Road in St Peter Port is the
OL,7,Froute that has been most impacted by
OL,8,Froad closures in Guernsey since 2020.
OL,10,FData from the States, revealed in
OL,11,Fresponse to a Freedom of Information
OL,12,Frequest, shows the top 10 roads
OL,13,Fimpacted by works are all in St Peter
OL,14,FPort, with Victoria Road impacted 284
OL,15,Ftimes.
OL,17,FIan Vaudin from Donkey Taxis said
OL,18,Froadworks have been "really painful"
OL,19,Fover the past few years and impacted
OL,20,Fhis profits.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
