OL,3,GNEWSALatest data shows roads most
OL,4,Aimpacted by closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of Travel and Transport
OL,7,FImplementation, Laura Oxburgh, said:
OL,8,F"No-one likes roadworks, but they are
OL,9,Fnecessary and we benefit from the works
OL,10,Fthat they enable."
